 "description": "The new tilt estimator integrates every gyro sample at 416 Hz, so the IMU driver must set the LSM6DS33 output data rate to 416 Hz. The IMU driver, which the estimator constrains, keeps the base sample_rate of 208 Hz with no reason given, so the estimator integrates at twice the rate new gyro data arrives (each sample used twice) and its tilt estimate drifts. It also disagrees with the 1.25 mA high-performance current now on the IMU node.",
 "edge": {
  "source": "control.tilt_estimator",
  "target": "firmware.imu_driver"
 },
